# Build context for app/apps/server/Dockerfile (context = repo root).
#
# The Dockerfile only COPYs the workspace manifests and app/apps/server, but
# `COPY app/apps/server` takes everything under it — so local secrets and
# host-built trees must never be in the context to begin with.

# Secrets and private configuration: never part of an image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
deploy/compose/cloudflared/
data/

# Host-built trees: rebuilt inside the image, and host binaries (macOS,
# Windows) would be wrong there anyway.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/target
**/.turbo

# Not needed to build the server.
.git
.github
docs
app/apps/desktop/src
app/apps/desktop/src-tauri
